cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MRS Amblyopia Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Preprocessing and quantification pipeline for edited MR spectroscopy
  (MEGA-PRESS, GABA+/Glx) data from a study of visual plasticity in adult
  amblyopia. Includes a Bash pipeline for organising MRI/MRS data, a Python
  package wrapping FSL and FSL-MRS, voxel-overlap scripts and an example
  notebook.
authors:
  - family-names: Fars
    given-names: Julien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7771-5029"
    affiliation: University of Oxford
repository-code: "https://github.com/julienfars/mrs_amblyopia_analysis"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - amblyopia
  - visual plasticity
  - MR spectroscopy
  - MEGA-PRESS
  - GABA
  - FSL-MRS
